    "updated_at": "2023-01-23T01:50:33Z",
    "body": "Personally, I don't think this is an infra issue (Infra is more of a \"standard library\" for specs, providing handy primitives like lists, maps. etc.). \r\n\r\nIt's more of a \"how to write a spec\" issue. We should eventually write a guide on best practices for spec writing.  ",
